                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more retroussé"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3cf302a3-044f-43b0-9a38-956240a5fe96",
                        "entry_id": "c816da7f-1dc4-3f0c-800e-f21a9e61738c",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most retroussé"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0c8bafef-13b2-3f73-a996-15fea6806482",
                        "entry_id": "c816da7f-1dc4-3f0c-800e-f21a9e61738c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Turned up, especially when describing the nose."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b6ea580-2c5d-4310-8f3a-33e63f46646a",
                                "sense_id": "0c8bafef-13b2-3f73-a996-15fea6806482",
                                "text": "[...] Roxelane [...] would never have been espoused by the Sultan [Suleiman the Magnificent] had not her nose been retroussé, thus[…]. / It may be noted that to this day a retroussé nose is known in France as a nose a la Roxelane."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "608f7586-dffb-4c2c-89d0-18332fd59864",
                                "sense_id": "0c8bafef-13b2-3f73-a996-15fea6806482",
                                "text": "\"A tight little craft,\" was Austin's invariable comment on the matron;[…]. Near her wandered her husband, orientally bland, invariably affable, and from time to time squinting sideways, as usual, in the ever-renewed expectation that he might catch a glimpse of his stiff, retroussé moustache."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bf7cceb-c586-4d93-91a1-d6782ff8cbfb",
                                "sense_id": "0c8bafef-13b2-3f73-a996-15fea6806482",
                                "text": "You know, a touch of character – slightly retroussé nose, big mouth, perhaps a couple of freckles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7fed390-854d-4021-8631-8a9728952371",
                                "sense_id": "0c8bafef-13b2-3f73-a996-15fea6806482",
                                "text": "Luminous silver gray eyes outlined in sooty lashes; a pert retroussé nose and faintly carmine tinted lips, slightly full, finished the oval face."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49f57bf4-462c-4e07-8b2f-a285c699700b",
                                "sense_id": "0c8bafef-13b2-3f73-a996-15fea6806482",
                                "text": "She shares with this woman the same retroussé nose and half-moon eyes, the same asymmetrical smile."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd53dc55-7826-4be0-a127-499d6ef5ef11",
                                "sense_id": "0c8bafef-13b2-3f73-a996-15fea6806482",
                                "text": "I would simply waffle about her small, almost perfectly upswept, retroussé nose, and you'd consider me insane, and put me back."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
